            </div>
            
            <h1 class="font-display text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
                Teknologi Pelestari <br class="hidden md:block"> 
                <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text gradient-primary relative">
                    Budaya Bangsa
                    <svg class="absolute w-full h-3 -bottom-1 left-0 text-accent/30 -z-10" viewBox="0 0 100 10" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M0 5 Q 50 10 100 5 L 100 10 L 0 10 Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
                </span>
            </h1>
            
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
                Menjembatani masa lalu yang berharga dengan masa depan yang cerdas melalui aplikasi yang intuitif, akurat, dan mudah digunakan oleh siapa saja.
            </p>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center">
                <a href="https://play.google.com" class="gradient-accent text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 flex items-center gap-3 text-lg w-full sm:w-auto justify-center">
                    <img src="/static/images/google_play_icon.webp" class="h-6 w-6 object-contain" alt="Play Store">
                    <span>Unduh Sekarang</span>
                </a>
                <a href="#features" class="bg-white text-gray-700 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full shadow-soft hover:shadow-md border border-gray-100 transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center">
                    Pelajari Fitur
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- UI Feature Showcase -->
    <section id="features" class="py-24 bg-white rounded-t-[3rem] shadow-[0_-20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            
            <!-- Image Transliteration -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 lg:p-12 mb-20 shadow-card hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-500 border border-gray-100 group">
                <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
                    <div>
                         <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-orange-100 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-orange-500 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                             <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
                         </div>
                         <h3 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 transition-colors">Transliterasi Gambar</h3>
                         <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8 leading-relaxed text-lg">
                             Teknologi OCR transliterasi canggih kami mampu mengenali dan mengubah teks Pegon horizontal menjadi teks latin. Cocok untuk alat bantu membaca teks pegon bagi yang tidak menguasai aksara pegon. Dapatkan hasil digital yang presisi dalam hitungan detik.
                         </p>
                         <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                             <div class="bg-white px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-3 hover:border-orange-200 transition-colors">
                                 <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500"></div>
                                 <span class="font-bold text-gray-700">Akurasi 95%+</span>
                             </div>
                             <div class="bg-white px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 flex items-center gap-3 hover:border-orange-200 transition-colors">
                                 <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></div>
                                 <span class="font-bold text-gray-700">Hasil teks latin</span>
                             </div>
                         </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative group/image">
                         <div class="absolute inset-4 bg-gradient-accent rounded-[2rem] blur-xl opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-1000"></div>
                         <img src="/static/images/transliterasi_gambar.webp" alt="Transliterasi Gambar" class="relative w-full h-auto rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl border-4 border-white transform transition duration-500 group-hover/image:scale-[1.02] group-hover/image:rotate-1">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Text Transliteration UI Mockup -->
            <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center mb-24">
                 <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 relative">
                     <!-- Abstract Decoration -->
                     <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-40 h-40 bg-teal-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60"></div>
                     <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-40 h-40 bg-yellow-100 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60"></div>
                     
                     <div class="relative group/image">
                         <div class="absolute inset-4 bg-teal-400 rounded-[2rem] blur-xl opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-1000"></div>
                         <img src="/static/images/transliterasi_teks.webp" alt="Transliterasi Teks" class="relative w-full h-auto rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl border-4 border-white transform transition duration-500 group-hover/image:scale-[1.02] group-hover/image:rotate-1">
                     </div>
                 </div>
                 
                 <div class="order-1 lg:order-2">
                     <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mb-8 text-primary hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-300">
                         <svg class="w-8 h-8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"></path></svg>
                     </div>
                     <h3 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Transliterasi Teks</h3>
                     <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed text-lg mb-8">
                        Ubah teks Latin ke Pegon dengan mudah dan cepat. Membantu penulisan teks pegon tanpa ribet dan instan.
                     </p>
                     <ul class="space-y-4">
                         <li class="flex items-center gap-4 group">
